            $"{wdResult.SilenceMs}ms while cpu pulses kept the inactivity deadline alive. " +
            $"Last signal: {wdResult.LastPulseSource}."),
        HardAbort: true,
        Kill: new KillSignature("output_silence_ceiling", wdResult.LastPulseSource, wdResult.SilenceMs, killedOutputPath));
}

